<style>
/* Layout: the RxC results template, in the Bradfield brand from nicoletteboele.com.au:
   teal #125b67 with dark teal, pale grey-teal bands and a coral accent; Bebas Neue for headings and Montserrat
   (the site's own stand-in for Avenir) for text. Two group colours of equal weight (gold, violet), neither of
   them the brand's teal or coral; coral never marks a group or the change most voters opposed. Three groups: Group 2
   came out of the same Polis group as Group 1, so it shares the gold, the fainter shade in each mode (lighter on white,
   deeper on dark); Group 3 keeps the violet. All three pass the dataviz palette check against the map card in both
   modes (all pairs; Group 2's contrast with the card is under 3:1, so every group is labelled in words as well). */
:root{
  --teal:#125b67; --teal-dk:#0a353c; --coral:#fc6868; --mist:#e1e9ea; --foam:#f2fafb; --ally:#67a5a7;
  --g1:#a97c0c; --g2:#dbac4e; --g3:#7562d4; --g1-soft:#f6f0e1; --g2-soft:#fcf7ea; --g3-soft:#efedfb;
  --paper:#ffffff; --ink:#1b2a2d; --heading:#125b67; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#56666a;
  --line:rgba(18,91,103,.18); --track:#dde6e7; --tint:#f2fafb; --deep:#0a353c; --frame:#125b67;
  --display:"Bebas Neue","Oswald","Arial Narrow",system-ui,sans-serif;
  --text:"Montserrat",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;
  color-scheme:light;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
  padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
    --g1:#bb8b1a; --g2:#7c5a02; --g3:#8d7ce6; --g1-soft:#272212; --g2-soft:#1f1b10; --g3-soft:#1e1c36;
    --paper:#0b1b1e; --ink:#e4eef0; --heading:#e4eef0; --card:#11282c; --muted:#a3b7ba;
    --line:rgba(255,255,255,.15); --track:#24393d; --tint:#0e262a; --deep:#061719; --frame:rgba(255,255,255,.15); color-scheme:dark;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --g1:#bb8b1a; --g2:#7c5a02; --g3:#8d7ce6; --g1-soft:#272212; --g2-soft:#1f1b10; --g3-soft:#1e1c36;
  --paper:#0b1b1e; --ink:#e4eef0; --heading:#e4eef0; --card:#11282c; --muted:#a3b7ba;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.15); --track:#24393d; --tint:#0e262a; --deep:#061719; --frame:rgba(255,255,255,.15); color-scheme:dark;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
body{margin:0;font-family:var(--text);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.wrap{max-width:77.5rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;margin:0;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--heading)}
p{margin:0}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:3px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:.62rem 1.2rem .56rem;border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:1.42rem;letter-spacing:.03em;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid var(--teal);cursor:pointer}
.btn.solid{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}
.btn.line{background:transparent;color:var(--teal)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;flex:none}
.dot.g1{background:var(--g1)} .dot.g2{background:var(--g2)} .dot.g3{background:var(--g3)}
.pill{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:.34rem .7rem .28rem}
q{quotes:"“" "”"}

/* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero{background:var(--mist);color:var(--teal-dk);overflow:hidden}
.hero h1{color:var(--teal)}
.hero :focus-visible{outline-color:var(--teal-dk)}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;padding:80px 0 92px}
/* The headline is three set lines, the middle one boxed like the teal labels on the MP's site. Its longest line,
   box included, is 10.05em wide in Bebas Neue, so it is sized from its column (9.8cqi) and capped by the window height. */
.hero-text{container-type:inline-size;min-width:0}
.hero h1{font-size:min(9.8cqi,11vh,6.4rem);line-height:1;margin-bottom:26px}
.hero h1 .ln{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.hero h1 .box{display:inline-block;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;padding:.07em .2em .02em;margin:.08em 0 .1em -.2em;border-radius:.03em}
.hero .sub{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.5;max-width:31rem;margin-bottom:32px;font-weight:500}
.hero .turnout{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:22px}
.actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero .btn.line{color:var(--teal);border-color:var(--teal)}
/* the sticker is the brand's coral with dark teal type (4.6:1); white on coral would be too faint */
.sticker{position:relative;width:8.25rem;height:8.25rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral);color:var(--teal-dk);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;transform:rotate(-12deg);z-index:3;padding:0 .75rem}
/* its type is set a little tight, so every line stays at least 4px inside the coral disc at 16px and 20px text */
.sticker b{display:block;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:2.1rem;line-height:1;margin:.06rem 0 .08rem}
.sticker span{display:block;font-size:.58rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1}

/* Hero (the common format, 19 November): one label per group (its size, name and a one-line description, linking
   down to its card) and the circle for what all three groups agree on (linking to the agreement section). No quote
   cards: residents' words are in the group cards. Only the circle is tilted. */
/* The hero sentence runs the full width of its column */
.hero .sub{max-width:none}
/* The intro sits above the finding sentence and is styled like it, a paragraph's gap between them */
.hero .sub.intro{margin-bottom:.75em}
.hero .cards{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;position:relative;padding:0}
.hero .glabels{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.hero .glabel{display:block;position:relative;text-decoration:none;color:var(--teal-dk);background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 44px 15px 22px;border-left:8px solid var(--gc);box-shadow:0 14px 30px -18px rgba(6,40,46,.55);width:calc(100% - 9.5rem)}
/* the labels are white in both modes, so their small text keeps a fixed dark grey (5.9:1 on white) */
.hero .glabel small{display:block;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#56666a;margin-bottom:2px}
.hero .glabel b{display:block;font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700}
.hero .glabel em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.35;color:#56666a;margin-top:3px}
.hero .glabel .chev{position:absolute;right:16px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:1.15rem;color:#56666a}
.hero .glabel:hover b,.hero .glabel:focus-visible b{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.hero .glabel:focus-visible,.hero .sticker:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal-dk);outline-offset:3px}
/* the circle sits against all three labels, its ring in bands: Group 1's colour on top, Group 2's at the sides and
   Group 3's underneath ("from 12deg" undoes the -12deg tilt) */
.hero .sticker{position:absolute;right:-6px;top:50%;margin:0;width:10.5rem;height:10.5rem;transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(-12deg);border:7px solid transparent;text-decoration:none;
  background:linear-gradient(var(--coral),var(--coral)) padding-box,conic-gradient(from 12deg,var(--g1) 0 60deg,var(--g2) 0 120deg,var(--g3) 0 240deg,var(--g2) 0 300deg,var(--g1) 0) border-box}
.hero .sticker:hover{transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(-12deg) scale(1.03)}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .hero .sticker:hover{transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(-12deg)} }
@media (min-width:901px) and (max-height:53em){
  .hero .glabels{gap:12px}
  .hero .glabel{padding:11px 40px 12px 18px}
  .hero .glabel b{font-size:1.08rem}
  .hero .glabel em{font-size:.84rem}
  .hero .glabel small{font-size:.74rem}
}
@media (max-width:900px){
  .hero .glabel{width:auto}
  .hero .sticker{position:relative;top:auto;right:auto;transform:rotate(-12deg);align-self:center;margin-top:6px}
  .hero .sticker:hover{transform:rotate(-12deg)}
}
@media (min-width:901px){
  .hero-grid{padding-top:clamp(28px,calc(100vh - 41.5rem),80px)}
}
/* Short windows, or large text in a window that isn't tall: a smaller headline and smaller paragraphs. 46em follows
   the reader's text size (736px at 16px, 920px at 20px). The README says where the buttons fit since the intro. */
@media (min-width:901px) and (max-height:46em){
  .hero h1{font-size:min(9.8cqi,9.2vh,6.4rem);margin-bottom:16px}
  .hero .sub{font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:20px}
  .hero .turnout{margin-top:14px}
}
/* very short windows for the text size (under 32em: 512px at the standard text size, 640px at 20px) */
@media (min-width:901px) and (max-height:32em){
  .hero h1{font-size:min(9.8cqi,8vh,6.4rem);margin-bottom:12px}
  .hero .sub{font-size:.98rem;margin-bottom:16px}
  .hero .btn{font-size:1.25rem}
}
@media (min-width:901px) and (max-height:43.25em),(min-width:901px) and (max-width:62.5em) and (max-height:53em){
  .hero-grid{align-items:start}
}

/* ---------- sections ---------- */
section.block{padding:104px 0}
.head{margin-bottom:46px}
.head h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,4.6vw,4.3rem);line-height:.98;max-width:20ch;text-wrap:balance}
.head p{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.5;max-width:36rem}
.head .head-line{margin-top:18px;max-width:42rem}
/* a heading with a lead: side by side on wide screens, so neither leaves half the width empty */
.head.side{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px 56px;align-items:end}
.head.side .head-line{margin-top:0}
.deep{background:var(--deep);color:#fff}
.deep h2{color:#fff}
.deep .head p{color:#d2e1e3}
.tint{background:var(--tint)}

/* ---------- group cards ---------- */
/* one card per group, one under another, each with its statements side by side, so no column runs half empty */
.groups-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:28px;margin-top:48px}
.gcard .glab{font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--heading);margin:4px 0 12px}
.gcard .gboxes + .glab,.gcard .gcols + .glab{margin-top:22px}
.gboxes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.gboxes .qbox{margin-top:0}
/* Group 2's card: a column for each neighbour it sides with, then the statement it backs more than both */
.gcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.gcol{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.gcol .qbox{margin-top:0}
.qbox.wide{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.6fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px 28px;align-items:center}
.qbox.wide q{margin-bottom:0}
@media (max-width:62.5em){ .gboxes,.gcols,.qbox.wide{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)} }
.gcard{border-radius:18px;padding:26px 30px 30px;background:var(--gsoft);border-top:12px solid var(--gc)}
.gcard.one{--gc:var(--g1);--gsoft:var(--g1-soft)} .gcard.two{--gc:var(--g2);--gsoft:var(--g2-soft)} .gcard.three{--gc:var(--g3);--gsoft:var(--g3-soft)}
.gtop{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:18px;margin-bottom:20px}
.gtop .big{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:4.6rem;line-height:.85;color:var(--heading);white-space:nowrap}
.gtop .big small{font-size:.5em}
.gtop .who{font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.3;padding-bottom:4px}
.gtop .who b{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:400;font-family:var(--display);letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.05;color:var(--heading)}
.gtop .who b .dot{width:14px;height:14px}
.qbox{background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px 18px;margin-top:12px}
.qbox q{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:1.06rem;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:12px}
.qbox.lead q{font-size:1.2rem}
.qbox .lab{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
/* Group 2's card: where it sides with each neighbour */
.side-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;margin:0}
.pcts{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:.95rem}
.pcts span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.pcts b{font-weight:700}
.small-note{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:22px;max-width:46rem}
.sub-head{margin:84px 0 26px}
.sub-head.first{margin-top:0}
.sub-head h3{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,3.2vw,3rem);line-height:1}

/* ---------- map: one row along the main divide ---------- */
.map-card{position:relative;border:2px solid var(--frame);border-radius:18px;padding:22px 26px 18px;background:var(--card)}
.map-lead{font-weight:600;font-size:1.02rem;margin-bottom:8px;max-width:46rem}
.map-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}
.someone{font:inherit;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:.03em;line-height:1;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:4px;padding:.55rem 1rem .5rem;cursor:pointer}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .someone{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .someone{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
#map{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;touch-action:manipulation;cursor:crosshair;overflow:visible}
#map .pdot{transition:transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.2,1),fill .6s ease,opacity .6s ease}
#map .axis{stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:2}
#map .axis-label{fill:var(--ink);font-family:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.map-hint{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.map-hint .h-touch{display:none}
@media (hover:none){.map-hint .h-fine{display:none}.map-hint .h-touch{display:inline}}
/* each group's name (and count, on wide screens) over its heap */
#map .grp-name{fill:var(--ink);font-family:var(--text);font-weight:700}
#map .st-count{fill:var(--muted);font-family:var(--text)}
.person{position:absolute;z-index:5;width:21rem;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px 14px;box-shadow:0 18px 40px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.5);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.42;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px);transition:opacity .15s ease,transform .15s ease}
.person.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
.person .pg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:.98rem;margin-bottom:6px}
.person .pn{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}
.person .pn b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.person .lean-h{font-weight:600;font-size:.86rem;margin:12px 0 7px}
.likes{display:grid;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}
.lk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) 2.2em;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.84rem}
.lk span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap}
.lk .bar{display:block;height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--track);overflow:hidden}
.lk .bar i{display:block;height:100%}
.lk b{text-align:right}
.lean-n span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.lean-n b{font-weight:700}
.person .note{margin-top:10px;font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.42}
.person .ex{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:9px;margin-top:10px}
.person .ex .exl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.person .ex q{display:block}

/* ---------- dumbbells ---------- */
.dumb{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:14px;overflow:visible}
.dumb .trk{stroke:var(--trk,var(--track))}
.dumb .rng{stroke:var(--rng,var(--ink))}
.dumb .tick{fill:var(--tk,var(--muted));font-family:var(--text)}
.dumb .ring{stroke:var(--ring,var(--card))}
.vals{display:flex;gap:8px 22px;font-size:.98rem;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.vals span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.vals b{font-weight:700}
.nn{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;font-size:.88em}

/* ---------- pairs ---------- */
.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:28px;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink)}
.pair .topic{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;padding:26px 34px 0}
.pair .topic h3{font-size:2.2rem;line-height:1}
.pair .topic .n{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.half{padding:22px 34px 30px}
.half.split-half{margin:18px 0}
.half.agree{background:var(--mist);color:var(--teal-dk);margin:18px 18px 18px 0;border-radius:14px;--trk:rgba(10,53,60,.2);--rng:var(--teal-dk);--tk:var(--teal-dk);--ring:var(--teal-dk)}
.half.agree .nn{color:var(--teal-dk)}
.half.agree .dot{box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--teal-dk)}
.half q{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1.36;min-height:4.08em;margin-top:14px}
details.all{margin-top:8px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-top:18px}
details.all summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;padding:.2rem 0}
.all-list{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;column-count:2;column-gap:44px}
.all-list li{break-inside:avoid;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.all-list q{display:block;font-weight:500;line-height:1.45}
.all-list .vals{color:#d2e1e3;font-size:.9rem;margin-top:4px}
.all-list .dumb{--trk:rgba(255,255,255,.22);--rng:#fff;--tk:#c6d8db;--ring:var(--deep);margin-top:10px}
.all-list .sid{color:#c6d8db;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:4px}
.all-list .nn{color:inherit;opacity:.85}

/* ---------- priorities ---------- */
.how{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--frame);border-radius:14px;padding:26px 32px;margin-bottom:40px}
.costs{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:flex-end}
.cost{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.92rem;text-align:center}
.cost b{font-weight:700}
.sq{display:grid;gap:3px}
.sq i{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--mist);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--teal)}
.sq.s1{grid-template-columns:repeat(1,16px)} .sq.s4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,16px)} .sq.s9{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,16px)}
.how p.cap{font-size:1.06rem;line-height:1.5;max-width:36rem}
.finding{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;color:var(--heading);font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.6vw,2.3rem);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 26px;max-width:44rem;letter-spacing:.01em}
.prio-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
.pcard{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:26px 26px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:2px solid var(--frame)}
@supports (grid-template-rows:subgrid){.pcard{display:grid;grid-row:span 5;grid-template-rows:subgrid;row-gap:0}.pcard .echo{align-self:start}}
.pcard .rank{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:3rem;line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--heading)}
.pcard .tt{margin-bottom:22px;flex:1}
.pcard p.t{font-weight:600;font-size:1.06rem;line-height:1.36}
/* each change leads with its net votes, which set the order; one bar on a shared scale (the top change is full width) */
.tally{margin:0 0 12px}
.tally .big{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.45rem;margin:0 0 12px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:3.4rem;line-height:.9;color:var(--heading)}
.tally .big span{font-family:var(--text);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}
.tbar{height:10px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--track);overflow:hidden}
.tbar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:5px;background:var(--teal)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .tbar i{background:var(--ally)}}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .tbar i{background:var(--ally)}
.pstats{font-size:.95rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pstats b{font-weight:700}
.pcard .pstats{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
.echo{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:18px;padding-top:14px}
.echo .el{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.echo .en{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.echo q{display:block;font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.42;margin-bottom:4px}
.echo .vals{font-size:.9rem;margin-top:6px}
.no-card{margin-top:28px;background:var(--teal-dk);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:34px 38px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
.no-card h3{font-size:2.6rem;line-height:1;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--mist)}
.no-card p.t{font-weight:600;font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.36;margin-bottom:14px}
.no-card p.s{color:#d2e1e3;font-size:1rem}
.no-card .tally .big{color:#fff}
.no-card .tally .big span{color:#d2e1e3}
details.rest{margin-top:28px;border-top:2px solid var(--frame);padding-top:18px}
details.rest summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;padding:.2rem 0}
.rest-list{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0}
.rest-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.rest-list .r{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:1.8rem;line-height:1;color:var(--heading)}
.rest-list .t{font-weight:600}
.rest-list .s{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.6rem}
.rest-list .rnet{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--heading)}
.rest-list .rs{font-size:.9rem}

/* ---------- how this worked ---------- */
.steps{list-style:none;margin:0 0 30px;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}
.step{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;border:2px solid var(--frame);border-radius:14px;padding:24px 24px 26px;background:var(--card)}
.step .fig{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:3.4rem;line-height:.9;color:var(--heading)}
.step h3{font-family:var(--text);font-weight:600;font-size:1.06rem;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.3;margin-top:4px;color:var(--ink)}
.step p{font-size:.96rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted)}
details.fine{border-top:2px solid var(--frame);padding-top:18px}
details.fine summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;padding:.2rem 0}
details.fine .arows{margin-top:14px}
.arows{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.arow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);column-gap:32px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.arow > p{grid-column:2}
.arow h3{font-family:var(--text);font-weight:600;font-size:1.08rem;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.35;color:var(--ink)}
.arow p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6;max-width:44rem}
.arow p + p{margin-top:.6rem}

/* ---------- what happens next + footer ---------- */
.next{background:var(--teal);color:#fff;padding:104px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.next h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(3rem,5.4vw,5rem);line-height:.95;margin-bottom:24px}
.next-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,38rem) auto;justify-content:start;gap:48px 88px;align-items:center}
.next p{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.5;max-width:32rem;margin-bottom:32px}
.next .btn.solid{background:#fff;color:var(--teal);border-color:#fff}
.next :focus-visible{outline-color:#fff}
.next .sticker2{justify-self:center;width:15rem;height:15rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral);color:var(--teal-dk);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;transform:rotate(-10deg);padding:1.2rem}
.next .sticker2 b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:3rem;line-height:.95;display:block}
footer{background:var(--teal-dk);color:#fff;padding:48px 0 56px}
.foot{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px}
.foot strong{font-weight:600}
.foot .ack{color:#c6d8db;font-size:.95rem}

@media (max-width:900px){
  .wrap{padding:0 20px}
  .hero-grid,.head,.head.side,.groups-row,.pair,.no-card,.foot,.sub-head,.next-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .head.side .head-line{margin-top:18px}
  .sub-head{margin:64px 0 20px}
  .how{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;padding:22px}
  .costs{gap:20px}
  .arow{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px;padding:18px 0}
  .arow > p{grid-column:auto}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
  .step{padding:20px}
  .step .fig{font-size:2.8rem}
  .next{padding:72px 0}
  .next .sticker2{width:10.625rem;height:10.625rem}
  .next .sticker2 b{font-size:2.1rem}
  .hero-grid{padding:28px 0 64px;gap:28px}
  .hero h1{font-size:min(9.8cqi,4.2rem)}
  .hero .sub{font-size:1.1rem}
  section.block{padding:72px 0}
  .head{gap:18px;margin-bottom:30px}
  .gtop .big{font-size:3.6rem}
  .gcard{padding:22px 20px 24px}
  .map-card{padding:16px 14px 14px;border-radius:14px}
  .person{position:static;width:auto;opacity:1;transform:none;margin-top:12px;box-shadow:none;display:none}
  .person.on{display:block}
  .half.agree{margin:0 14px 14px}
  .half.split-half{margin:6px 0 0}
  .pair .topic{padding:22px 22px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .pair .topic h3{font-size:1.9rem}
  .half{padding:18px 22px 24px}
  .half q{min-height:0}
  .all-list{column-count:1}
  .prio-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .no-card{padding:28px 22px;gap:22px}
  .rest-list li{grid-template-columns:2.4rem 1fr}
  .rest-list .s{grid-column:2;white-space:normal}
}
@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){
  .pair,.pcard,.no-card{transition:opacity .2s ease}
  #pairs:has(.pair:hover) .pair:not(:hover),
  #priorities:has(.pcard:hover) .pcard:not(:hover),
  #priorities:has(.pcard:hover) .no-card,
  #priorities:has(.no-card:hover) .pcard{opacity:.25}
}
@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine) and (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .pair,.pcard,.no-card{transition:none} }
@media (max-width:520px){ .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr} }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ #map .pdot,.person,.gl{transition:none} .btn:hover,.gl:hover{transform:none} }

/* ---------- RxC site shell (shared with the other project microsites) ---------- */
.rxc-shell{--ink:#17203A;--paper:#fff;--common:#EDFF38;--quiet:#5F657E;--hair:#D9DBE3;--voice-b:#E23A6B;
  font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;box-sizing:border-box}
.rxc-shell *{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}
.rxc-shell a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.rxc-shell a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.3em}
.rxc-shell a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #2B3EFF;outline-offset:3px}
.rxc-shell .wrap{max-width:78rem;margin:0 auto;padding:.75rem clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.rxc-shell.top{border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}
.rxc-shell.bottom{border-top:1px solid var(--hair);font-size:14px;color:var(--quiet)}
.rxc-shell.bottom a{color:var(--ink)}
.rxc-shell .crumbs{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;color:var(--quiet);min-width:0}
.rxc-shell .crumbs a{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
.rxc-shell .crumbs span.here{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.rxc-shell .status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;color:var(--quiet)}
.rxc-shell .status i{width:.5rem;height:.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--voice-b);display:inline-block}
.rxc-shell .btn{border:2px solid var(--ink);padding:.45rem .8rem;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;line-height:1;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit;letter-spacing:0}
.rxc-shell .btn:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);text-decoration:none}
.rxc-shell .right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.rxc-shell .btn{border-radius:0;background:transparent;display:inline-block}
.rxc-shell .btn:hover{transform:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="rxc-shell top" role="banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="12" height="12"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="12" height="12"/></svg>RadicalxChange</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="here">Bradfield on migration</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="right">
      <span class="status"><i></i>Preliminary results, data to 1:37pm AEDT, 18 November 2026</span>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:info@radicalxchange.org?subject=Bradfield%20migration%20results">Contact the team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1><span class="ln">Bradfield wants</span><span class="ln"><span class="box">homes and services planned</span></span><span class="ln">for migration</span></h1>
        <p class="sub intro">Multiculturalism is central to Australia’s story, identity and future. As debate over migration levels and settings continues, this process offers a more nuanced, participatory way for communities to give feedback on immigration policy.</p>
        <p class="sub">People disagree about how many should come, and who should come first. But most want migration planned with homes, roads, schools and hospitals, so services keep pace.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="btn solid" href="#groups">See what Bradfield said</a><a class="btn line" href="#priorities">The changes people want most</a></div>
        <p class="turnout">Since 2 November 2026 · 422 people have taken part · 344 in a group</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="glabels" role="list" aria-label="The three groups">
          <div role="listitem"><a class="glabel" href="#group-1" style="--gc:var(--g1)"><small>Group 1 · 218 people</small><b>Migration works</b><em>Migration keeps us going; keep families together.</em><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
          <div role="listitem"><a class="glabel" href="#group-2" style="--gc:var(--g2)"><small>Group 2 · 61 people</small><b>Works, but slower</b><em>Values what migration brings, but it’s too fast.</em><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
          <div role="listitem"><a class="glabel" href="#group-3" style="--gc:var(--g3)"><small>Group 3 · 65 people</small><b>Fewer, chosen more carefully</b><em>Too many, too fast; be stricter on who stays.</em><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
        </div>
        <a class="sticker" href="#agree" aria-label="More than 7 in 10 in all three groups want housing and infrastructure to keep pace with population. See what they agree on."><div aria-hidden="true"><span>More than</span><b>7 in 10</b><span>in all three groups want housing and infrastructure to keep pace with population</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="block" id="groups" aria-labelledby="groups-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 id="groups-h">Most people fit into one of three groups</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="sub-head first"><h3>Where everyone sits</h3></div>
    <div class="map-card" id="map-card">
      <p class="map-lead">Each dot is one person, placed by how they voted. People who voted alike sit close together, so the higher the pile, the more people voted that way.</p>
      <svg id="map" viewBox="0 0 1000 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="map-desc"><desc id="map-desc">344 people placed along the main divide in the votes. Group 1, Migration works, 218 people, sits to the left in a high pile. Group 2, Works, but slower, 61 people, sits next to it. Group 3, Fewer, chosen more carefully, 65 people, spreads out to the right, overlapping the edge of Group 2.</desc></svg>
      <div class="map-foot">
        <button class="someone" type="button" id="someone">Show me someone</button>
      </div>
      <div class="person" id="person" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <p class="map-hint"><span class="h-fine">Hover over a dot to see how that person voted.</span><span class="h-touch">Tap the map or press “Show me someone” to see how one person voted.</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="groups-row">
      <div class="gcard one" id="group-1">
        <div class="gtop"><span class="big">2<small> in </small>3</span><span class="who"><b><i class="dot g1"></i>Group 1: Migration works</b>218 people</span></div>
        <p class="glab">What sets them apart</p>
        <div class="gboxes">
          <div class="qbox"><q>Migration is about people, not just workers. Families being able to live together should count as much as economic contribution.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>82%</b> of Group 1 agree</span><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>17%</b> of Group 2</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>7%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div>
          <div class="qbox"><q>As a lucky country, we have a duty to keep helping people who aren't so lucky, even when it costs us.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>84%</b> of Group 1 agree</span><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>23%</b> of Group 2</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>2%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div>
          <div class="qbox"><q>Migration keeps my workplace and my community going. Cutting it back would cost us more than it would save.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>81%</b> of Group 1 agree</span><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>25%</b> of Group 2</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>2%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gcard two" id="group-2">
        <div class="gtop"><span class="big">1<small> in </small>6</span><span class="who"><b><i class="dot g2"></i>Group 2: Works, but slower</b>61 people</span></div>
        <p class="glab">Where they stand</p>
        <div class="gcols">
          <div class="gcol"><p class="side-h"><i class="dot g1"></i>Like Group 1 · Migration works</p>
            <div class="qbox"><q>The food, festivals and friendships migration has brought are a big part of what makes life here good. We'd be a duller place without them.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>96%</b> of Group 2 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>99%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>35%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div>
            <div class="qbox"><q>Australia needs more than top professionals. We rely on aged care and disability workers from overseas, so there should be a real visa pathway for them even though the pay is low.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>80%</b> of Group 2 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>89%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>33%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="gcol"><p class="side-h"><i class="dot g3"></i>Like Group 3 · Fewer, chosen more carefully</p>
            <div class="qbox"><q>For me, trust comes down to the numbers: too many people have arrived too quickly for our communities to keep up.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>76%</b> of Group 2 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>19%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>81%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div>
            <div class="qbox"><q>The culture of my community is changing faster than people can adjust, and it's fair to worry about that.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>80%</b> of Group 2 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>24%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>85%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <p class="glab">More than both other groups</p>
        <div class="qbox wide"><q>I'd trust the system more if ordinary people got clear information about how it works and a real say in it.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>92%</b> of Group 2 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>61%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>69%</b> of Group 3</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gcard three" id="group-3">
        <div class="gtop"><span class="big">1<small> in </small>5</span><span class="who"><b><i class="dot g3"></i>Group 3: Fewer, chosen more carefully</b>65 people</span></div>
        <p class="glab">What sets them apart</p>
        <div class="gboxes">
          <div class="qbox"><q>Immigration should be discriminatory. We should only take the best.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>74%</b> of Group 3 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>12%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>29%</b> <span class="nn">(17 voted)</span> of Group 2</span></div></div>
          <div class="qbox"><q>We should welcome skilled migrants only if they are already sponsored by an employer.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>53%</b> of Group 3 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>11%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>0%</b> <span class="nn">(11 voted)</span> of Group 2</span></div></div>
          <div class="qbox"><q>Australia is too lax on who can gain permanent residency / citizenship.</q>
            <div class="pcts"><span><i class="dot g3"></i><b>71%</b> of Group 3 agree</span><span><i class="dot g1"></i><b>9%</b> of Group 1</span><span><i class="dot g2"></i><b>31%</b> <span class="nn">(13 voted)</span> of Group 2</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="small-note">The people who joined in aren’t a random sample, so these groups describe who took part, not all of Bradfield. 78 people aren’t in a group: they voted on too few statements, or didn’t agree or disagree with any.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block deep" id="agree" aria-labelledby="agree-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head side">
      <h2 id="agree-h">Even where they disagree, they agree on something</h2>
      <p class="head-line">At least 7 in 10 people in every group agreed with 12 statements. Here are five of them, each beside a related statement the groups disagree on.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="pairs"></div>
    <details class="all">
      <summary>See all 12 statements all three groups agreed with</summary>
      <ol class="all-list" id="all"></ol>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block tint" id="priorities" aria-labelledby="prio-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 id="prio-h">The six changes people want most</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="how">
      <div class="costs" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="cost"><div class="sq s1"><i></i></div><p><b>1 vote</b><br>1 credit</p></div>
        <div class="cost"><div class="sq s4"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p><b>2 votes</b><br>4 credits</p></div>
        <div class="cost"><div class="sq s9"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p><b>3 votes</b><br>9 credits</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="cap">At a community session on 3 November, 49 people used quadratic voting to spread a budget of credits across 13 possible changes, for or against. Each extra vote on the same idea costs more, so the totals show what people care about most.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="finding">In the conversation, most people in every group agreed with two of the top six.</p>
    <div class="prio-grid" id="prio"></div>
    <div class="no-card">
      <div><h3>And one clear no</h3><p class="t" id="no-t">Prioritise migrants in high-paying jobs, using salary rather than shortage lists to decide who qualifies.</p><p class="s" id="no-s">25 people opposed it and 12 backed it.</p></div>
      <div><div class="tally"><p class="big" id="no-net">−32<span>net votes</span></p></div></div>
    </div>
    <details class="rest">
      <summary>See the other six changes</summary>
      <ol class="rest-list" id="rest"></ol>
    </details>
